has an air of peacefulness around her <br><i>\u221e  Why is Cordelia afraid of sharp objects? Why does she suffer from panic attacks?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869560/extras/bb56ad6dac6a44ba2db0f22de5fca14a.avif?t=1754650417\" width=576 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Josheni</strong><br>- Always smiles and acts friendly, gets along well with the others easily, absolutely non-confrontational <br><i>\u221e  Is Josheni as invincible as he thinks? Will he be able to find his most precious treasure in &quot;Amnea&quot;?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869560/extras/7097f8ec3a97cce317c645d4448d773d.avif?t=1754650417\" width=576 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869560/extras/2e3a92713edbe35967838e5a050bed0a.avif?t=1754650417\" width=576 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e  After finding out the four main characters' secrets the fifth route will be unlocked - the story of the protagonist herself, who is the closest to unravelling the old hotel's mysteries. Afterwards, the second part of her route will be revealed, leading to the true ending.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869560/extras/8b1703bc0b98c7d4e3941ec49e0181ad.avif?t=1754650417\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
